'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Map of Tarkov|location]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''. It is the twelfth map that was added to the game.

==Description==
The southern port Terminal has been under Russian Armed Forces control since the beginning of the Tarkov conflict. After the city was sealed off, the terminal was fortified and became the primary evacuation point, sought by both civilian refugees and PMC units. According to unconfirmed reports, TerraGroup personnel were also evacuated through this port.

==Notes==
* When leaving this location by either dying or extracting, the state of the character is returned as it was before entering, besides the consumed access item.
[[File:ShorelineIMIntercomButton.png|thumb|right|300px|Port garrison intercom]]
* This location can only be entered through [[Transits|transiting]] from [[Shoreline]] in the time period of 21:00-6:00 after presenting an access item at the port garrison intercom.
